{
  "_comment": "Money and shops. Every trainer starts with startMoney Poké Dollars and earns koMoney for each Pokémon their party knocks out (wild: base + perLevel x level; trainer-owned: that times trainerMult). Vendors stand at the market stalls of each town (stall index 0-2 in the map's npcs); every town's gear stall also sells that town's type-boosting item. The challenger waits in the castle courtyard: press E beside him to battle; beat his whole team for the reward (once per match). It is a friendly bout: if your party faints he withdraws, your Pokémon are patched up at the castle healer, and you may try again after retrySeconds. The medicine stall of each town also sells its town stones (townStones, two per town, all ten between them) at townStonePrice; stones are not in item balls and the Wandering Merchant does not sell them. Any shop buys items back at half the lowest price a shop asks (Match.sellPrice).",
